e=\"color: #ba372a; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Exercise 3</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Translate these sentences into English using the suggested words. You can change the form if necessary. </strong><em>(Dịch các câu sau sang tiếng Anh sử dụng từ gợi ý. Có thể thay đổi dạng từ nếu cần.)</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #ba372a; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Exercise 4</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Listen and fill in the gaps with ONE WORD.</strong> <em>(Nghe và điền vào chỗ trống với 1 TỪ.)</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">1. <audio src=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1773810517.mp3\" controls=\"controls\"> Your browser does not support the audio element. </audio> </p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">2. <audio src=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1773810527.mp3\" controls=\"controls\"> Your browser does not support the audio element. </audio> </p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">3. <audio src=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1773810539.mp3\" controls=\"controls\"> Your browser does not support the audio element. </audio></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"> </p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px; line-height: 1.5;\"> </p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px; line-height: 1.5;\"> </p>",
