              "id": 101547,
              "content": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Benefits of In-store Shopping</strong></span></p>\n<p data-start=\"205\" data-end=\"597\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">In-store shopping has several benefits for customers. Firstly, it allows people to check products carefully before<span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong> [input_0]</strong></span>. Customers can touch the products and feel their <span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong>[input_1]</strong></span> in real life. They can also check the true <span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong>[input_2]</strong></span> of the items they want to buy. For example, shoppers can <span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong>[input_3] </strong></span>to make sure they fit well and look good on them. Secondly, shopping in <span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong>[input_4]</strong></span> gives people a chance to <span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong>[input_5]</strong></span> and <span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong>[input_6] </strong></span>with friends. Many people enjoy walking around <span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong>[input_7] </strong></span>and looking at different products even when they do not plan to buy anything. As a result, shopping can become an enjoyable<span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"> <strong>[input_8]</strong></span> that helps people relax an<span style=\"color: #000000;\">d </span><span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">spend <span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong><strong>[input_9]</strong></span></span> </strong></span>with friends.</span></p>"
